{
  "schema": "loom.analysis_prompt/1",
  "id": "semantic.analysis",
  "version": 1,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": [
        "Analyse the following chat message. Return ONLY valid JSON (no markdown, no backticks).\n\n{\n  \"entities\": [{\"name\": \"...\", \"kind\": \"person|org|place|code|file|concept|product|event\", \"relevance\": 0.0-1.0}],\n  \"topics\": [{\"label\": \"...\", \"confidence\": 0.0-1.0}],\n  \"relations\": [{\"subject\": \"...\", \"predicate\": \"mentions|depends_on|references|contradicts|implements|part_of\", \"object\": \"...\"}],\n  \"summary\": \"one line summary\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive|negative|neutral|mixed\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Extract ALL named entities (people, orgs, code modules, files, concepts).\n- Topics should be domain labels (legal, finance, tech, ai, security, health, project, personal).\n- Relations connect entities mentioned in the text.\n- Be precise. Fewer high-confidence items > many low-confidence ones.\n- If the message is trivial (greetings, \"ok\", etc.) return empty arrays.\n\nMessage:\n",
        {
          "binding": "text",
          "max_codepoints": 3000
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "request_parameters": {
    "temperature": 0.1,
    "max_tokens": 800
  },
  "transport": {
    "timeout_ms": 30000,
    "body_field_order": [
      "model",
      "messages",
      "temperature",
      "max_tokens"
    ],
    "headers": {
      "Content-Type": "application/json",
      "HTTP-Referer": "https://github.com/chatadhd",
      "X-Title": "ChatADHD-Semantic"
    }
  },
  "analysis_parameters": {},
  "output_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "entities": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "kind": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "relevance": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": true
        }
      },
      "topics": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "label": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "confidence": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "relations": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "subject": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "predicate": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "object": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": true
        }
      },
      "summary": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "sentiment": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": true
  },
  "validation_mode": "off",
  "extensions": {
    "output_preservation": "raw_and_unknown_fields"
  }
}
